{"version":1,"content":"<p><strong>DeepSeek據報完成1000億人民幣融資 寧德時代騰訊牽頭</strong></p><p>・DeepSeek傳完成融資<br>・規模達1000億人民幣<br>・由寧德時代牽頭<br>・騰訊亦有參與投資<br>・AI領域備受資本追捧<br>・融資詳情有待確認</p><p>暫時未能從am730擷取全文。</p><p><a href=\"https://www.am730.com.hk/財經/1059730/deepseek據報完成1000億人民幣融資-寧德時代騰訊牽頭\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">閱讀原文</a></p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-22T15:41:39.200483+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":121,"images":0,"source":"am730","fallback":"minimal","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-22T08:29:36+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-22T15:37:13.629557+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-22T15:37:13.629557+00:00","content_hash":"9463a81ed7aab9ea87d031ca0f39fe77fc4cfc90f1be9ebdfcefe7b098c4357a","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}